<br>
&nbsp; I am only concerned with offereing newer , faster, and more secure c=
ipher suites on our web application, so that as clients have the ability to=
 use them they can begin to do so.<br>
<br>
&nbsp; Our LB offers a method to present baoth an RSA and ECC cert at thw a=
ame time, at the cost of buying both each year.<br>
<br>
&nbsp; I can only support ecdsa_rsa unless I have an ECC certificate to sup=
port ecsda_ecsde ciphers.<br>
<br>
&nbsp; Since TLS 1.3 will continue to allow ecdsa_rsa ciphers, there will b=
e no push to move towards offering them, because of various 'reasons'.<br>
<br>
Ben<br>
